OL,3,GNEWSAEvacuation plans over WW2 bomb cut
OL,4,Ato 300 homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 300 homes are set to be
OL,7,Fevacuated on Wednesday as experts
OL,8,Fcontinue to deal with a suspected
OL,9,Funexploded bomb in a town, down from
OL,10,F1,300 homes in an earlier announcement.
OL,12,FA 300m (984ft) exclusion zone is
OL,13,Fcurrently in place after the suspected
OL,14,F250lb (115kg) American World War Two
OL,15,Fdevice was found in water near Falmouth
OL,16,FDocks on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
