OL,3,GNEWSAEvacuation plans over WW2 bomb cut
OL,4,Ato 300 homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FCornwall Council said earlier the
OL,7,Fcordon was "expected to expand" to
OL,8,F1,400m (4,593ft) on Wednesday, with the
OL,9,Fpossible evacuation of up to 1,309
OL,10,Fhomes, however, that was later revised
OL,11,Fto 755m (2,477ft), with an estimated
OL,12,F339 homes affected.
OL,14,FSupt Ian Thompson, of Devon and
OL,15,FCornwall Police, urged those within the
OL,16,Fcordon to leave their homes by 09:00
OL,17,FBST.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
